@startuml COMP-SEQ10
!include ../_theme.puml
title COMP-SEQ10 UC10 直播发布、观看与实时互动（组件级）
actor "主播" as A
actor "观众" as V
participant "LiveStudioPage" as SP
participant "LiveRoomPage" as RP
participant "liveApi" as API
participant "Live / Interaction Handler" as H
participant "WebSocket Handler" as WS
participant "Live Hub" as Hub
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "SRS" as SRS

A -> SP: 开始直播
SP -> API: createLive
API -> H: POST /live
H -> DB: 创建/复用房间并重置本场统计
DB --> H: 事务提交
H --> API: room + streamKey
API --> SP: 更新直播工作台
SP -> WS: 连接 /ws/live-publish/:id
WS -> SRS: 转发 WebM 媒体
V -> RP: 进入直播间
RP -> API: detail + interaction + danmaku
RP -> WS: 连接 /ws/live/:id
WS -> Hub: Register(client)
Hub -> DB: 更新 viewer_count/viewer_peak
Hub --> RP: viewer_count
V -> API: 点赞/礼物
API -> H: interaction request
H -> DB: 事务写入并更新统计
H -> Hub: BroadcastEvent
Hub --> RP: live_like / live_gift
V -> WS: 发送弹幕
WS -> Hub: 权限/慢速模式校验
Hub -> DB: 保存 live danmaku
Hub --> RP: danmaku
@enduml
